<section id="landing-tutorial" class="fullscreen about desktop">
	<div class="finda-logo desktop">
		<div class="tutorial_images">
			<div class="tutorial_image active"><img src="/images/tutorial/tutorial1.jpg" /></div>
			<div class="tutorial_image"><img src="/images/tutorial/tutorial2.jpg" /></div>
		</div>
		<div class="finda-logo-container"></div>
	</div>
	<div class="tutorial-details">
		<h1><span>&nbsp;</span>Booking models with Idal</h1>
		<div class="tutorial-finda-scroll">
			<div class="about-finda">
				<section id="step1" class="staff">
					<div class="full-height">
						<h3>Step 1</h3>
						<h2>Create your profile</h2>
						<p>To start booking with us, you need to create your profile.</p> 
						<p>After you have registered, filled in all the necessary information and uploaded your ID for verification, our dedicated team will carefully check your details and notify you if your profile has been approved to book models via Idal.</p> 
						<p>To keep our platform safe and professional, we only allow people and companies from the fashion, marketing and advertising industries to book with us.</p>
					</div>
				</section>
				<section id="step2" class="staff">
					<div class="full-height">
						<h3>Step 2</h3>
						<h2>Create a new project</h2>
						<p>Once your account has been verified you can start creating projects with us.</p> 
						<p>On the ‘Projects’ page you will be able to create projects and specify all the necessary information including a desired usage and a rate.</p> 
						<p>As soon as your project has been saved, you will be able to filter and discover the best-fit models for your chosen criteria.</p> 
					</div> 
				</section>
				<section id="step3" class="staff">
					<div class="full-height">
						<h3>Step 3</h3>
						<h2>Request a booking</h2>
						<p>When you have found a talent you want to work with on your project, you can send a booking request.</p>
						<p>Once sent they will see your project description and a proposed rate.</p> 
						<p>If they are happy with your offer - you are ready to go!</p> 
					</div> 
				</section>
				<section id="step4" class="staff">
					<div class="full-height">
						<h3>Step 4</h3>
						<h2>Pay for the booking</h2>
						<p>Before the start of the booking, a service agreement outlining the service description, your payment method and usage rights of the produced photographs or videos will be generated for you.</p> 
						<p>You will need to choose an appropriate payment method before the start of a booking and pay an invoice within a period of time outlined in the letter of service agreement.</p>
					</div>
				</section>
				<div class="bottom-gap desktop">
					<div class="seperator" data-gap="4"></div>
					<div class="seperator" data-gap="4"></div>
					<div class="seperator" data-gap="4"></div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		{include file="mobile/mobilefooter.tpl"}
	</div>
	<div id="scroll-indicator-bullets" class="desktop">
